      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nabesna%2C_Alaska",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "After the mine shut during WWII, the camp faded into a ghost town, later listed on the National Register in 1979.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
